WEBVTT

00:05:59.744 --> 00:06:03.156
whichever of those cosmic forces wins,

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:04.330
we lose.

00:06:05.157 --> 00:06:10.137
All those pessimistic accounts
of the human condition

00:06:10.161 --> 00:06:12.470
contain some truth,

00:06:12.494 --> 00:06:14.422
but as prophecies,

00:06:14.446 --> 00:06:17.517
they're all misleading,
and all for the same reason.

00:06:17.962 --> 00:06:22.267
None of them portrays humans
as what we really are.

00:06:22.688 --> 00:06:25.100
As Jacob Bronowski said,

00:06:25.124 --> 00:06:29.045
"Man is not a figure in the landscape --

00:06:29.069 --> 00:06:31.847
he is the shaper of the landscape."